<title>USA: Standard Products Co Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Standard Products Co Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>DEARBORN, Mich. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Earnings Summary (Unaudited) (000 omitted)</p>
<p>					     Q3	     Nine Months</p>
<p>				     1997	1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net sales		    $281,774 $277,274 $814,005 $780,781</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>   Cost of goods sold	243,013  243,395  718,256  715,727</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>	 administrative expenses</p>
<p>				    17,569   19,290   51,773   53,181</p>
<p>   Non-recurring charge     17,661	  0   17,661	  0</p>
<p>   Interest expense	    3,024    3,604    9,752   11,579</p>
<p> Other (income) expense	  228  (1,157)    (981)  (2,207)</p>
<p>Income before taxes on income</p>
<p>					 279   12,142   17,544    2,501</p>
<p>Provision for taxes on income</p>
<p>				     (236)    4,859    9,289    3,457</p>
<p>   Net income (loss)	     515    7,283    8,255    (956)</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per common share</p>
<p>					0.03     0.43     0.49   (0.06)</p>
<p>Average shares outstanding</p>
<p>				    16,808   16,755   16,802   16,752</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q3 includes pretax charge against earnings of $17.7 million, or $0.63/shr, on closing of parts plants in Schenectady, N.Y., and Lexington, Ky. In addition, co expensed about $0.03 per share of costs related to closings which did not qualify for immediate accrual. Excluding these charges, quarterly net was $11.6 million, or $0.69 per share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
